## End-to-end picture

| UI meaning | Frontend | DB |
|------------|----------|-----|
| Active | `status === 'active'` | `Stop` 0 or null |
| ��停 (yellow styling in Course Management) | `inactive` **and** `closed_reason` empty | `Stop = 1`, `closed_reason` null |
| 已結算 | `closed_reason === 'settled'` | `Stop = 1` (from batch close), `closed_reason = 'settled'` |
| 已結案 | `closed_reason === 'completed'` | `Stop = 1`, `closed_reason = 'completed'` (from 結案 / pause with reason) |

**Resume** clears **`closed_reason`** and **`Stop`** on the backend, so the course returns to full **active** presentation.

